4. Cryptographic key tables disclaimer
--------------------------------------
Interoperating with Take-Two Interactive's RPF8 archive format used by
Grand Theft Auto V historically requires binary lookup tables reproduced
from public reverse-engineering research published by the RAGE modding
community since 2014.

Those tables are NOT distributed in this repository. The application
downloads them at runtime; the paths it expects (`MiamiGraphics.Shell/Keys/`
and `additionals/keys/`) are empty here and are excluded from version
control.

The copyright holder of Miami Graphics makes no claim of ownership
over these tables and disclaims any liability arising from their use
or redistribution. If Take-Two Interactive, Rockstar Games, or any
authorized rights holder requests removal of these files, they will
be removed promptly upon receipt of such request directed to the
GitHub profile listed in this repository.

